[?2004l[?2004h>     {
[?2004l[?2004h>       "name": "layer1.weight",
[?2004l[?2004h>       "shape_match": true,
[?2004l[?2004h>       "shape_a": [4, 3],
[?2004l[?2004h>       "shape_b": [4, 3],
[?2004l[?2004h>       "max_abs_diff": 1.234,
[?2004l[?2004h>       "mean_abs_diff": 0.567
[?2004l[?2004h>     },
[?2004l[?2004h>     {
[?2004l[?2004h>       "name": "layer2.weight",
[?2004l[?2004h>       "shape_match": false,
[?2004l[?2004h>       "shape_a": [4, 3],
[?2004l[?2004h>       "shape_b": [8, 3]
[?2004l[?2004h>     },
[?2004l[?2004h>     {
[?2004l[?2004h>       "name": "layer3.bias",
[?2004l[?2004h>       "shape_match": false,
[?2004l[?2004h>       "shape_a": null,
[?2004l[?2004h>       "shape_b": [3]
[?2004l[?2004h>     }
[?2004l[?2004h>   ],
[?2004l[?2004h>   "summary": {
[?2004l[?2004h>     "total_tensors_a": 2,
[?2004l[?2004h>     "total_tensors_b": 2,
[?2004l[?2004h>     "common_tensors": 2,
[?2004l[?2004h>     "shape_mismatches": 0,
[?2004l[?2004h>     "only_in_a": [],
[?2004l[?2004h>     "only_in_b": []
[?2004l[?2004h>   }
[?2004l[?2004h> }
[?2004l[?2004h> ```
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> **Field rules:**
[?2004l[?2004h> - `file_a` and `file_b` are the basenames of `file1` and `file2`.
[?2004l[?2004h> - `tensor_diffs`: sorted by tensor name lexicographically.
[?2004l[?2004h> - `shape_a` and `shape_b`: tensor shapes from each file, or `null` if absent from that file.
[?2004l[?2004h> - `shape_match`: `true` only when the tensor exists in both files and the shapes are identical.
[?2004l[?2004h> - `max_abs_diff` and `mean_abs_diff`: present only for tensors with `shape_match: true`, computed over float32 element-wise absolute differences.
[?2004l[?2004h> - `summary.total_tensors_a` and `summary.total_tensors_b`: tensor counts in each file.
[?2004l[?2004h> - `summary.common_tensors`: number of tensor names present in both files.
[?2004l[?2004h> - `summary.shape_mismatches`: number of common tensors with different shapes.
[?2004l[?2004h> - `summary.only_in_a` and `summary.only_in_b`: tensor names present in only one file, sorted lexicographically.
[?2004l[?2004h> '''
