[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Method**: Exponential Weighted Moving Average (EWMA) over `grad_norm` values in timeline order
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Parameters**: `alpha = 0.1`; tracks EWMA mean and EWMA variance
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Warmup**: At least 30 entries with `grad_norm` before detection begins
