[?2004l[?2004h> - **Output fields**: `observed`, `ewma_mean`, `ewma_stddev`, `z_score`
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Evidence**: `window_values` contains up to 5 preceding `grad_norm` values
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### 2.2 Loss Divergence
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Method**: Exponential Moving Average (EMA) over `loss` values in timeline order
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Parameters**: `alpha = 0.05`
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Trigger**: `current_loss > 2.0 * ema_loss`
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Guard**: Ignore detection when `abs(ema_loss) <= 1e-6`
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Severity**: `critical` when `current_loss / ema_loss > 5.0`, otherwise `high`
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Output fields**: `current_loss`, `ema_loss`, `ratio`
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Evidence**: `window_values` contains up to 5 preceding `loss` values
[?2004l[?2004h> """
